<title>USA: United Tech's Pratt in $1.6 bln USAF deal.</title>
<headline>United Tech's Pratt in $1.6 bln USAF deal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Air Force said Monday it has awarded a $1.6 billion contract to United Technologies Corp. for 320 F117-PW-100 engines for C-17 transport planes.</p>
<p>It said the work will be done by Pratt &amp; Whitney Manufacturing Operations at Middletown, Conn., and is to be completed in April 2004.</p>
</text>
